        <item>
            <title>Isle 1.2.5</title>
            <link>https://github.com/rgranet/isle/releases/tag/v1.2.5</link>
            <sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1d1d1f; margin: 0; padding: 10px 6px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 6px; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #f5f5f7; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Isle 1.2.5</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Calendar: a &quot;more below&quot; chevron now appears on the events/reminders list when items are hidden under the fold, and disappears once you scroll to the bottom.</li>
      <li>Lyrics: Apple Music tracks now try their embedded lyrics first, with LRCLIB as a fallback; added diagnostics for missing lyrics.</li>
      <li>Settings: reorganized the sidebar — Messaging Apps moved to Productivity, Stats moved to System.</li>
      <li>New &quot;Contributors&quot; tab with a thank-you section and a donation option.</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>
            ]]></description>
